t Buddhist temple in Ampara, Sri Lanka. The temple lies on the Ampara \u2013 Mahaoya main road, approximately 27\u00a0km (17\u00a0mi) away from the town of Ampara. The temple has been formally recognised by the Government as an archaeological site in Sri Lanka.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Piyangala Aranya Senasanaya</b> or <b>Piyangala Forest Hermitage</b> is an ancient Buddhist temple in Ampara, Sri Lanka. The temple lies on the Ampara \u2013 Mahaoya main road, approximately 27\u00a0km (17\u00a0mi) away from the town of Ampara. The temple has been formally recognised by the Government as an archaeological site in Sri Lanka.</p>"}